---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="About Antoine | Savor & Stories"
  description="Meet Antoine, the guide behind Savor & Stories in Bordeaux and Dieppe."
>
  <div class="bg-green px-5 pt-8 pb-8 md:pt-14 md:pb-14 text-center">
    <h1 class="text-cream text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold">About Antoine</h1>
    <div class="w-10 h-0.5 bg-gold mx-auto my-3"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-[480px] md:max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <div class="flex justify-center -mt-12 md:-mt-16">
      <img
        src="/assets/photos/antoine-walking-cobblestones.jpg"
        alt="Antoine"
        class="w-24 h-24 md:w-32 md:h-32 rounded-full object-cover object-top border-4 border-cream shadow-md"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="px-4 md:px-6 pt-4 md:pt-6 pb-8 md:pb-14 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft space-y-4">
      <p>
        I'm Antoine, and I guide in two French towns that couldn't be more different. Bordeaux is wine, of course, but it's also 2,000 years of history, a river that built the city's fortune, and evenings where people gather over a drink to argue about pétanque. Dieppe is quieter, a place most visitors miss entirely: a working scallop port, a castle above the beach, chalk cliffs, and a 1942 raid that's part of the town's story.
      </p>
      <p>
        I keep my groups small because I want it to feel like a conversation, not a lecture. I'll answer your questions honestly and tell you where I actually go to eat.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="px-4 md:px-6 pb-8 md:pb-14">
      <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.15em] text-label uppercase font-bold text-center mb-4">Real tours, real guests</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 md:gap-4">
        <img src="/assets/photos/antoine-portrait-explaining.jpg" alt="Antoine talking with guests in Bordeaux" class="w-full h-28 md:h-40 object-cover rounded-xl border border-border" />
        <img src="/assets/photos/bordeaux-hotel-intendance-group.jpg" alt="A group tour in Bordeaux's old town" class="w-full h-28 md:h-40 object-cover rounded-xl border border-border" />
        <img src="/assets/photos/bordeaux-street-corner-group.jpg" alt="Antoine guiding a group through Bordeaux" class="w-full h-28 md:h-40 object-cover rounded-xl border border-border" />
        <img src="/assets/photos/bordeaux-chocolate-display.jpg" alt="A Bordeaux chocolate shop" class="w-full h-28 md:h-40 object-cover rounded-xl border border-border" />
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-label text-center mt-3">Real photos from real tours, not stock images.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
